    "chunk_text": "HNB launches \u2018Happiness Cards\u2019 campaign with Avurudu Savings\n\nHNB PLC has unveiled its \u2018Happiness Cards\u2019 campaign, offering seasonal savings and flexible payment options just ahead of the festive season.\n\nThe initiative provides cardholders with up to 70% savings, zero-interest instalment plans spanning up to 48 months, and benefits across over 300 merchant partners in categories including shopping, travel, dining, and electronics.\n\nHNB Vice President Upul Adikari said the card is positioned as an enabler of experiences, while Vice President Gauthami Niranjan noted the offering is tailored to seasonal spending patterns. Premium Visa cardholders also stand a chance to win a tour to the FIFA World Cup Finals 2026.\n\nSamsung Sri Lanka launches Galaxy S26 Series with advanced AI\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
