    "md5": "eb1fa99ce32463635e37ed7f16d9dee2",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1905,
    "chunk_text": "In 1984, during a conversation with the then Israeli representative to the UN, Binyamin Netanyahu (Bibi), the last Chabad-Lubavitch Rebbe, Menachem Mendel Schneerson, called the UN, \u201cThe House of Darkness\u201d. Donald Trump would agree. Since becoming president, he had made systematic moves to disengage with the UN system.\n\nIf Venezuela was the overture of this coming world, Iran was supposed to be its first act, not a forever war, but a violent excursion, short, fast, and cheap. Had Iran keeled over like Venezuela, the US might be in Cuba already. Given the claims made by Donald Trump and his adherents, who knows what would be next. Greenland most probably, then Mexico, Canada, Iceland\u2026\n\nIran\u2019s Islamic regime is as murderously intolerant as its monarchic predecessor (Teheran\u2019s Evin Prison is the perfect symbol of this political continuity; built under the Shah and managed by his notorious secret police SAVAK, it was stormed during the 1979 Iranian Revolution. But this Bastille was not destroyed; it was merely taken over by the mullahs who succeeded the Shah).\n\nIf a reminder of the true nature of the Iranian regime was necessary, there was the public execution of three protestors after a dubious trial on Nowruz, the Persian New Year. Nineteen year-old national wrestling star Saleh Mohammadi (and two other men) was arrested on January 15, 2026, charged with killing a police officer, convicted on February 4, executed in Qom on March 20.\n\nThe Iranian government constitutes a threat to Iranian citizens. But it does not pose a threat to the rest of the world.\n\nBibi Netanyahu and Donald Trump do. If they score an easy and fast victory in their unprovoked and illegal war against Iran, nothing will prevent them from riding roughshod over the world (including Europe), imposing not just their dominance but also their policies, ideas, values and ways of being on the rest of us."
