    "chunk_text": "Bibi Netanyahu and Donald Trump do. If they score an easy and fast victory in their unprovoked and illegal war against Iran, nothing will prevent them from riding roughshod over the world (including Europe), imposing not just their dominance but also their policies, ideas, values and ways of being on the rest of us.\n\nIt\u2019s towards just such a world (where a country can be punished with impunity for honouring its national laws or international obligations) the Bibi-Donald duo are planning to take us.\n\nIn June 2024, Uri Tzafon, a right wing Israeli organisation, sponsored a gathering called The First Lebanon Conference. According to a June 16, 2024 report in The Times of Israel, the purpose was to promote its solution to the Lebanese conflict: Annexation of territory and Jewish settlement; the Lebanese people to leave South Lebanon and for Israelis to occupy the land south of the Litani river and populate it.\n\nIn June 2024, that was a fringe position. Just one and a half years later, that fringe position is becoming the new reality. Under cover of its ground offensive against the Hezbollah, Israel is targeting civilian infrastructure in Southern Lebanon.\n\nCivilians living south of the Litani river and Beirut\u2019s southern suburbs have been ordered to vacate. Depopulation is underway, a prelude to repopulation and the extension of Israeli borders deep into Lebanon.\n\nIn the meantime, under the cover of Iran War, Israel has re-imposed starvation policy in Gaza and is expanding settlements in the West Bank."
