    "chunk_size_bytes": 1201,
    "chunk_text": "E-entrepreneurship and e-business are a revolutionary nexus of technology, entrepreneurship, and sustainability. Entrepreneurs have an important role in making e- business a catalyst for sustainability\n\nIn conclusion, e-entrepreneurship and e-business are a revolutionary nexus of technology, entrepreneurship, and sustainability. Although digital business models have immense environmental advantages through reduced resource utilisation and efficient functioning, they also pose new environmental challenges that cannot be overlooked. The future of sustainable development in the digital economy largely depends on how e-entrepreneurs address these challenges. By embracing green technology, reducing environmental impacts, and integrating sustainability into their fundamental strategies, e-entrepreneurs can develop businesses that are not only successful but also environmentally responsible. Finally, e-entrepreneurship has the ability to influence the development of a sustainable and inclusive global economy, proving that innovation and sustainability are not mutually exclusive concepts.\n\n(The author is a Final Year Student, University of Sri Jayewardenepura Department of Entrepreneurship)"
