    "chunk_text": "The characteristics of Fr. Aloy were his attachment to truth, boldness in stating it when necessary, and his constant observance of charity and love. He died at the age of 91. It is hoped that the work he left at Tulana\u2014preserving documentation and research\u2014will continue with the same dedication, as it represents a crucial contribution to developing local thinking and leadership for modern times.\n\nNaturally, Fr. Aloy Pieris will not be easily forgotten. I am sure many will have opportunities to record their encounters with him, which should be encouraged, because the life of this man illuminates not only his own journey but also matters of great importance to spiritual life and the life of this country."
